<title>USA: Ind. Housing Authority repriced, top yld unchanged.</title>
<headline>Ind. Housing Authority repriced, top yld unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said Wednesday it repriced and restructured Indiana Housing Finance</p>
<p>Authority's $25 million bond deal, lowering the yield in the</p>
<p>2027 maturity and leaving the top yield unchanged at 6.15</p>
<p>percent.</p>
<p>INDIANA HOUSING FINANCE AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $25,000,000*</p>
<p>SINGLE FAMILY MORTGAGE REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>1997 SERIES B</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>NOTE REPRICE AND RESTRUCTURE.</p>
<p>WE WILL CONTINUE TO TAKE ORDERS IN 2027.  ALL ORDERS IN 2024</p>
<p>AND 2030 WILL</p>
<p>BE CONSIDERED GOOD IN 2027.</p>
<p>2030 IS DONE PRIORITY.</p>
<p>					     5,000,000*</p>
<p>				   1997 SERIES B-1 (TAXABLE)</p>
<p>ATTENTION</p>
<p>THE BONDS ARE TAXABLE MUNICIPAL SECURITIES AND THIS OFFERING</p>
<p>IS SUBJECT TO REGULATION BY MUNICIPAL SECURITIES RULE MAKING</p>
<p>BOARD.  ALL ACTIVITY UNDERTAKEN WITH RESPECT TO THIS OFFERING</p>
<p>MUST BE SUPERVISED BY A MUNICIPAL SECURITY PRINCIPAL.</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: NAF</p>
<p>	   (EXPECTED)</p>
<p>DATED: 05/01/1997	    FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON</p>
<p>07/01/2012		5,000M    7.26  %</p>
<p>				 (Super Sinker)</p>
<p>(Avg. Life: 3.28 years based on 100% of FHA experience)</p>
<p>				   -------------------------</p>
<p>					TAXABLE INFORMATION</p>
<p> MATURITY	     TREASURY    SPREAD VS TREASURY</p>
<p>			   YIELD</p>
<p>07/01/2012		6.47	+79 over</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 01/01/2007    101.50</p>
<p>		   DTP 01/01/2009</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>					    20,000,000*</p>
<p>				     1997 SERIES B-2 (AMT)</p>
<p>			    SUBJECT TO ALTERNATIVE MINIMUM TAX</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: NAF</p>
<p>	   (EXPECTED)</p>
<p>DATED: 05/01/1997	    FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 01/01 &amp; 07/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON</p>
<p>07/01/2016		3,025M    6.00  %</p>
<p>01/01/2027	     11,890M    6.125 %</p>
