<p>CALL FEATURES: 01/01/2007    101.50</p>
<p>		   DTP 01/01/2009</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, May 7, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on May 29, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is clearing through DTC.</p>
